From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:15:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(day): "My day" on Today (weigh-in, calendar, Google
 Tasks) and a quieter Today

- TodayMyDaySection, right after the hero: this morning's weigh-in read
  straight from Health Connect (no wait for the 12-hour import), today's
  agenda from the phone's calendar store (READ_CALENDAR, nothing sent), and
  Google Tasks due today or overdue (opt-in, read-only, Play services'
  Authorization API with scope tasks.readonly). Weight and agenda re-read on
  every resume. Long-press the tasks block to disconnect.
- VictorTodayQuiet: the long explainer notes (scores building, calibrating
  baseline, carried sleep, new here) start dismissed, once per install; a
  test fails if upstream renames their card ids.
- play-services-auth 21.2.0 with its lock state and sha256 verification.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
